{"unit":11,"items":54,"pass":38,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 11","tracks":{"a112":"Track_11.2.mp3"},"SEGS":{"st1":["a112",3.83,27.6],"st2":["a112",37.78,63.33]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 11 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Crime and regret</h2>\n      <p>Six parts, <b>54 questions</b>, covering everything in Unit 11, with four questions that come back from Units 1&ndash;10. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>38 out of 54</b> to pass. Parts 7 and 8 are your writing and speaking &mdash; they are not marked automatically, but do not skip them. You can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u11\">\n\n      <!-- ============ PART 1 · VOCABULARY ============ -->\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;12</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the word that fits.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">He got into the house through a window at night. He is a&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">victim</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">suspect</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">burglar</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">The court gave him a two-year&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">sentence</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">theft</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">consequence</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">She did not go to prison. She simply had to pay a&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">punishment</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">fine</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">permission</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">He never checks anything before he presses send. He is completely&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">unfashionable</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">unintended</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">careless</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Match each word to what it means. Click one on the left, then one on the right.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5&ndash;9</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"pairbox\">\n          <div class=\"pcol\">\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"l\" data-key=\"q1\">capture</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"l\" data-key=\"q2\">suspect</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"l\" data-key=\"q3\">victim</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"l\" data-key=\"q4\">regret</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"l\" data-key=\"q5\">upset</button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pcol\">\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"r\" data-key=\"q3\" data-short=\"the person harmed\">the person something was done to</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"r\" data-key=\"q5\" data-short=\"make somebody unhappy\">make somebody unhappy or hurt</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"r\" data-key=\"q1\" data-short=\"catch\">catch somebody who was running</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"r\" data-key=\"q4\" data-short=\"wish you hadn&rsquo;t\">wish you had not done something</button>\n            <button class=\"pit\" data-side=\"r\" data-key=\"q2\" data-short=\"thought to have done it\">the person the police think did it</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Complete each sentence with one word from the box: <b>permission &middot; delay &middot; inconvenience</b>.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">He uploaded the video without asking anybody&rsquo;s <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"permission\" data-why=\"Ask somebody&rsquo;s <b>permission</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">Please accept my apologies for the <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"delay\" data-why=\"Apologize for the <b>delay</b>.\"> in replying.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">Apologies for any <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"inconvenience\" data-why=\"A fixed collocation: any <b>inconvenience</b> caused.\"> this may cause.</span></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ PART 2 · GRAMMAR ============ -->\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Grammar &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 13&ndash;26</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">If he had stayed in one place, the police&hellip; him in a week.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">would find</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">would have found</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">would have find</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">If anyone&hellip; hurt in one of those landings, there would have been no song.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">was</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">would have been</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">had been</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">I&hellip; that message at eleven at night. It was a mistake.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">should never have sent</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">should never send</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">shouldn&rsquo;t never have sent</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">You&hellip; to your manager before the meeting. There is still time.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">should have spoken</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">should speak</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">should to speak</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">What really happened? Choose.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">I should have asked for an extension. <select data-answer=\"N\" data-why=\"<b>I did not ask</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"D\">I did ask</option><option value=\"N\">I did not ask</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">18</span><span class=\"body\">I shouldn&rsquo;t have asked for an extension. <select data-answer=\"D\" data-why=\"<b>I did ask</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"D\">I did ask</option><option value=\"N\">I did not ask</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">19</span><span class=\"body\">She must have seen it. <select data-answer=\"S\" data-why=\"<b>I am sure she did</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"C\">I am criticizing her</option><option value=\"S\">I am sure she did</option></select></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Put the words in brackets into the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">20</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>not / steal</i>) If he <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"hadn't stolen|had not stolen\" data-why=\"Past perfect in the <i>if</i> clause of a third conditional.\"> the plane, nobody would have heard of him.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">21</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>check</i>) I <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"should have checked\" data-why=\"Criticizing something that was not done.\"> the file name before I uploaded it.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">22</span><span class=\"body\">(<i>might / get</i>) He <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"might have got|might have gotten\" data-why=\"A softer hypothetical past result.\"> a lighter sentence if he had given himself up.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Complete each sentence with the correct form.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">23</span><span class=\"body\">If he <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"had left\" data-why=\"Never <b>would have</b> after <i>if</i> &mdash; the condition takes the past perfect.\"> earlier, he would have escaped.</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">24</span><span class=\"body\">You <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"should have asked\" data-why=\"<b>Should have</b> needs the past participle: <i>should have asked</i>.\"> before you shared it.</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Write the second sentence so that it means the same as the first.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">25</span><span class=\"body\">Nobody checked the fingerprints, so he stayed free.<br>If somebody <input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"had checked the fingerprints, he wouldn't have stayed free|had checked the fingerprints he would have been caught|had checked the fingerprints, he would have been caught\" data-why=\"Flip the condition, and the result follows.\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">26</span><span class=\"body\">Rewrite formally, without <i>if</i>: If I had known, I would have said something.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"had i known, i would have said something|had i known i would have said something\" data-why=\"<b>Had I known&hellip;</b> &mdash; the inversion replaces <i>if</i>.\"></span></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ PART 3 · READING ============ -->\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 3 &middot; Reading &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 27&ndash;34</span></div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Read the whole text once before you answer anything.</p>\n\n      <article class=\"reading\">\n        <h3>The letter that arrived thirty years late</h3>\n        <p class=\"stand\">A police force in the Netherlands has a small office that does nothing but write to people who were robbed decades ago.</p>\n        <p><span class=\"pmark\">A</span>The scheme began by accident. An officer clearing out a storeroom in 2011 found several hundred items that had been recovered from burglaries in the 1980s and never returned, because the paperwork had been lost. Rather than destroy them, she started writing letters. Most of the objects were worth very little. Almost none of the replies were about the objects.</p>\n        <p><span class=\"pmark\">B</span>What people wrote back about was the break-in. One woman said she had stopped sleeping in the front bedroom and had never moved back. A man explained that his father had died three months after the robbery and that the two events had become fixed together in his memory, unfairly. Several people said the same thing in different words: nobody had ever told them what happened afterwards, and they had assumed nobody had looked.</p>\n        <p><span class=\"pmark\">C</span>That assumption was usually wrong. In most of the cases the file showed real work &mdash; interviews, fingerprints, sometimes an arrest that had not led to a charge. The information had simply never travelled back to the person it concerned. If the force had written a single paragraph in 1986, one researcher argues, half of these letters would have been unnecessary.</p>\n        <p><span class=\"pmark\">D</span>The office now employs four people and handles cases from any year. Its measure of success is deliberately modest: it does not claim to solve crimes or return property. It claims only that a person who is told what was done on their behalf reports feeling differently about it, sometimes thirty years later. Whether that should be part of policing is argued about every time the budget comes up.</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the best answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">27</span><span class=\"body\">How did the scheme start?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a government minister ordered it</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">an officer found unreturned items in a storeroom</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">victims took the police to court</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">28</span><span class=\"body\">What did most people write back about?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the value of the stolen objects</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">compensation they were owed</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the effect the break-in had had on them</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">True, False, or Not given? Choose for each sentence.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">29</span><span class=\"body\">The items had never been returned because the paperwork was lost. <select data-answer=\"T\" data-why=\"Paragraph A says exactly that.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"F\">False</option><option value=\"T\">True</option><option value=\"N\">Not given</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">30</span><span class=\"body\">The police had done no work on most of the old cases. <select data-answer=\"F\" data-why=\"Paragraph C: in most cases the file showed <b>False</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"N\">Not given</option><option value=\"T\">True</option><option value=\"F\">False</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">31</span><span class=\"body\">Other countries have set up similar offices. <select data-answer=\"N\" data-why=\"Other countries are never mentioned.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"N\">Not given</option><option value=\"T\">True</option><option value=\"F\">False</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">32</span><span class=\"body\">The office claims that it solves old crimes. <select data-answer=\"F\" data-why=\"Paragraph D: it <b>False</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option value=\"T\">True</option><option value=\"F\">False</option><option value=\"N\">Not given</option></select></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Answer the last two questions about the whole text.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">33</span><span class=\"body\">The researcher&rsquo;s point about &ldquo;a single paragraph in 1986&rdquo; is that\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">telling people at the time would have prevented most of the harm</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the letters are too long</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the police should have kept better storerooms</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">34</span><span class=\"body\">Why does the writer call the office&rsquo;s measure of success &ldquo;deliberately modest&rdquo;?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">because it has very few staff</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">because it promises only a change in how people feel, not results</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">because it refuses to accept any budget</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ PART 4 · LISTENING ============ -->\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 4 &middot; Listening &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 35&ndash;40</span></div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Read the questions first. Then play the recording twice.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio\" onclick=\"playClip('st1',this,'Stop')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Story 1\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio\" onclick=\"playClip('st2',this,'Stop')\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Story 2\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Navigate B1+ &middot; Audio 11.2</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the best answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">35</span><span class=\"body\">What went wrong in story 1?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">she was rude about her boss online</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">she posted a party video by accident and her boss saw it</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">she was filmed without permission</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">36</span><span class=\"body\">What went wrong in story 2?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">he was late for the interview</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">he insulted his own company online</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">he wrote about a rude interviewer and lost the job</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Complete the notes with one word.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">37</span><span class=\"body\">Story 2 &mdash; the person who had been rude to him was one of the <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"interviewers\" data-why=\"One of the <b>interviewers</b> had been rude.\"> .</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">38</span><span class=\"body\">Story 2 &mdash; he knew it was a mistake as soon as he pressed <input class=\"gap\" data-answer=\"send\" data-why=\"As soon as he pressed <b>send</b>.\"> .</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">What should each person have done? Choose.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">39</span><span class=\"body\">Story 1: she should have&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">checked which video she was uploading</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">deleted her account</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">told her boss first</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">40</span><span class=\"body\">Story 2: he shouldn&rsquo;t have&hellip;\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">gone to the interview at all</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">answered the rude question</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">said anything negative about the interviewer online</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ PART 5 · FUNCTIONAL LANGUAGE ============ -->\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 5 &middot; Functional language &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 41&ndash;48</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Does the apology match the situation? Choose.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">41</span><span class=\"body\">You are two minutes late meeting a friend for coffee. <select data-answer=\"Sorry, the bus was late.\" data-why=\"A tiny problem takes a tiny apology.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>Please accept my sincerest apologies for my inexcusable behaviour.</option><option>I must apologize unreservedly for this delay.</option><option>Sorry, the bus was late.</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">42</span><span class=\"body\">You missed a client meeting completely. <select data-answer=\"I&rsquo;d like to apologize &mdash; I take full responsibility.\" data-why=\"A serious failure needs the blame taken explicitly.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>I&rsquo;d like to apologize &mdash; I take full responsibility.</option><option>Sorry about that!</option><option>These things happen, don&rsquo;t they?</option></select></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">43</span><span class=\"body\">You said something unkind and meant it at the time. <select data-answer=\"I shouldn&rsquo;t have said it, and I&rsquo;m sorry.\" data-why=\"Own the action, not the other person&rsquo;s reaction.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>I&rsquo;m sorry, but you started it.</option><option>I&rsquo;m sorry you took it that way.</option><option>I shouldn&rsquo;t have said it, and I&rsquo;m sorry.</option></select></span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Real apology, or not a real apology at all?</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">44&ndash;47</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"sortbox\">\n          <div class=\"sortpool\"><button class=\"swd\" data-col=\"Real\">It was entirely my fault.</button><button class=\"swd\" data-col=\"Fake\">I&rsquo;m sorry you feel that way.</button><button class=\"swd\" data-col=\"Real\">I should never have copied in the whole team.</button><button class=\"swd\" data-col=\"Fake\">I&rsquo;m sorry if anybody was offended.</button></div>\n          <div class=\"sortcols\"><div class=\"sortcol\" data-col=\"Real\"><h5>A real apology</h5><div class=\"drop\"></div></div><div class=\"sortcol\" data-col=\"Fake\"><h5>Not really an apology</h5><div class=\"drop\"></div></div></div>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Put the four parts of the message of apology in order.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">48</span><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"order\" data-order=\"y2,y4,y1,y3\">\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"y1\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">I have written to the team this morning to say that the criticism was mine.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"y2\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">I would like to apologize for the email I sent to the whole team yesterday.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"y3\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">Please accept my apologies. It will not happen again.</span></button>\n          <button class=\"ochip\" data-val=\"y4\"><span class=\"pin\"></span><span class=\"txt\">It was my fault: I should never have copied everybody in.</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <!-- ============ PART 6 · PUTTING IT TOGETHER ============ -->\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 6 &middot; Putting it together &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 49&ndash;54</span></div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Complete the conversation. Two of these gaps come back from earlier units. <span class=\"pill-rec\">recycled</span></p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"chat\">\n          <div class=\"msg\"><b>Dana</b>Everybody has seen that email now.</div>\n          <div class=\"msg you\"><b>You</b>I know. I <select data-answer=\"should never have\" data-why=\"The strongest self-criticism.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>should never</option><option>should never have</option><option>shouldn&rsquo;t never have</option></select> written it at eleven at night.</div>\n          <div class=\"msg\"><b>Dana</b>Has the director said anything?</div>\n          <div class=\"msg you\"><b>You</b>Not yet, but he <select data-answer=\"must have seen\" data-why=\"A deduction about the past, not a criticism.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>must have seen</option><option>should have seen</option><option>must see</option></select> it &mdash; he replied to the thread.</div>\n          <div class=\"msg\"><b>Dana</b>What are you going to do?</div>\n          <div class=\"msg you\"><b>You</b>Write to her properly. If I <select data-answer=\"had waited\" data-why=\"An unreal past condition &rarr; past perfect.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>waited</option><option>would have waited</option><option>had waited</option></select> until the morning, I would have said none of it.</div>\n          <div class=\"msg\"><b>Dana</b>And the tone?</div>\n          <div class=\"msg you\"><b>You</b>Plain. <select data-answer=\"It was entirely my fault.\" data-why=\"Takes the blame without hedging.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>I&rsquo;m sorry if she was offended.</option><option>It was entirely my fault.</option><option>These things happen.</option></select> <span class=\"pill-rec\">recycled</span> The message <select data-answer=\"has already been sent\" data-why=\"A finished result in the passive. <b>has already been sent</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>has already sent</option><option>is already sending</option><option>has already been sent</option></select> to the whole team, so I cannot undo it. <select data-answer=\"Would it be possible to\" data-why=\"An indirect request. <b>Would it be possible to</b>.\"><option value=\"\">&mdash;</option><option>Would it be possible to</option><option>You need to</option><option>I want you to</option></select> talk to her before the meeting?</div>\n        </div>\n      </span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n\n    <!-- ============ PART 7 · WRITING ============ -->\n    <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:30px\">Part 7 &middot; Writing &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">assessed against the criteria</span></div>\n    <p class=\"subline\">Write 120&ndash;140 words. Give yourself twenty-five minutes.</p>\n    <div class=\"opentask\" data-open data-tid=\"test-write\">\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"body\">\n        <p class=\"ohint\"><b>The task.</b> Write a message of apology for something you sent, said or did in a hurry. Apologize in one line. Accept the fault and name exactly what was wrong. Say why you are sorry &mdash; the harm to the other person, not to yourself. Say what you have already done about it. Close with a promise. Do not ask to be forgiven.</p>\n        <textarea placeholder=\"Dear&hellip;   I&rsquo;d like to apologize for&hellip;   It was my fault.   I should never have&hellip;   I&rsquo;m sorry &mdash; not because&hellip;, but because&hellip;   I&rsquo;ve already&hellip;   It won&rsquo;t happen again.\" data-track></textarea>\n      </span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bubble useful\">\n      <div class=\"blab\">Your message must contain</div>\n      <ul>\n        <li>one <b>should never have</b> or <b>shouldn&rsquo;t have</b> naming the exact action</li>\n        <li>one <b>third conditional</b>: <i>If I had&hellip;, I would have&hellip;</i></li>\n        <li>the reason you are sorry, expressed as harm to the <b>other</b> person</li>\n        <li>something you have <b>already</b> done to put it right</li>\n        <li>no <i>I&rsquo;m sorry if&hellip;</i> and no <i>I&rsquo;m sorry you feel&hellip;</i> anywhere</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ============ PART 8 · SPEAKING ============ -->\n    <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 8 &middot; Speaking &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">assessed against the criteria</span></div>\n    <div class=\"opentask speak\" data-open data-tid=\"test-speak\">\n      <div class=\"sp-head\"><span class=\"sp-ic\">&#127908;</span>\n        <div><b>Speaking &mdash; the road not taken, and the apology</b><span>Extended turn</span></div></div>\n      <p class=\"sp-task\"><b>Part A.</b> Describe a turning point in your life or in a story you know, and say what would have happened if it had gone the other way. Build a chain of three consequences. <b>Part B.</b> Then apologize out loud for something, in four moves: say sorry, take the blame, say what you should have done, say how you will fix it.</p>\n      <ul class=\"sp-list\">\n        <li>three third conditionals, each following from the one before</li>\n        <li>one mixed conditional: a past cause with a result about <b>now</b></li>\n        <li>one <b>should have</b> and one <b>could have</b>, doing different jobs</li>\n        <li>no <i>would have</i> after <i>if</i>, ever</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"sp-lang\"><b>Use this language</b>If I hadn&rsquo;t&hellip;, I would have&hellip; &middot; I might never have&hellip; &middot; &hellip;so I wouldn&rsquo;t be here today &middot; I should never have&hellip; &middot; You could have&hellip; &middot; It won&rsquo;t happen again.</div>\n      <div class=\"rec\">\n        <div class=\"rec-row\">\n          <button class=\"rec-btn\" type=\"button\" onclick=\"recToggle(this)\" aria-label=\"Record your answer\" title=\"Record\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 14a3 3 0 0 0 3-3V6a3 3 0 0 0-6 0v5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3zm5-3a5 5 0 0 1-10 0H5a7 7 0 0 0 6 6.9V21h2v-3.1A7 7 0 0 0 19 11z\"/></svg></button>\n          <div class=\"rec-label\"><b>Record your answer</b><span>Press the microphone and speak</span></div>\n          <div class=\"rec-wave\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n          <div class=\"rec-time\">0:00</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rec-takes\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rec-note\">Record it, play it back, then submit it for assessment.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:30px\">Parts 7 and 8 &middot; Assessment</div>\n    <p class=\"subline\">These two parts are not marked automatically and they are not marked by you. Submit your writing and record your speaking, then your teacher &mdash; or the AI tutor &mdash; scores each part against the criteria below and writes the feedback.</p>\n    <div class=\"rubric-slot\">\n      <ul class=\"reqlist\">\n        <li>I named exactly what I did wrong, not just that something went wrong</li>\n        <li>I said I was sorry for the harm to the other person</li>\n        <li>I said what I had already done about it</li>\n        <li>I never wrote <i>I&rsquo;m sorry if&hellip;</i> or <i>I&rsquo;m sorry you feel&hellip;</i></li>\n        <li>my three consequences each followed from the one before</li>\n        <li><i>would have</i> never appeared after <i>if</i></li>\n        <li>my mixed conditional put a past cause with a present result</li>\n        <li>I apologized out loud without adding an excuse to it</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n"}